# Example Mosquitto ACL (copy/adapt into the add-on if enabling ACLs).
# Restrict the zigbee2mqtt user to its own topic tree.

user zigbee2mqtt
topic readwrite zigbee2mqtt/#

# Home Assistant's MQTT integration user (full access on its discovery prefix):
user homeassistant
topic readwrite homeassistant/#
topic readwrite zigbee2mqtt/#
